  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani okoagacha Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 3:1-7)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’amagana ane, na emerongo etano na etato, magega Abaisraeli kobarure ense ya Misiri, noro omwaka o kane bw’okogaamba gwa Sulemani igoro y’Abaisraeli, ase omotienyi o Sivu, omotienyi o kabere, Sulemani agachaaka koagacha enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomba eria omorwoti Sulemani aagacherete Omonene nigo yareenge iga: Obotambe bwaye nobw’ekerengo ki’amaboko emerongo etano nomo, na obogare bwaye amaboko emerongo ebere, na obotambe bwaye gochia igoro amaboko emerongo etato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomba eria yaagachetwe bosio bwe Hekalu enyene nigo yareenge iga: Obotambe bwaye gochia ime nobw’ekerengo ki’amaboko ikomi, na obogare bwaye amaboko emerongo ebere, nigo bwareng’aine nobogare bwe Hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani akaroisia ase enyomba eria ebibao bi’emete; ebibao ebio tibiareenge koigorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akaagacha chinyomba chinde inse, chinyasi chiaye chichomeranirie ne chinyasi chi’enyomba enyene ase amakere na magega, akanachana ebinyomba imeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obogare bw’ebinyomba bia inse nigo bwareenge bw’ekerengo ki’amaboko atano, na ebie rirongo ria kabere amaboko atano na rimo, na ebie rirongo ria gatato amaboko atano na abere. Nigo akorete ebitambokero bikabwatana nenyasi ye Hekalu ase kera rirongo, erinde emeriibo egosiira kera rirongo etoorere ase ebitambokero ebio, etari gosoigwa ase enyasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero enyomba yaagachetwe, igo yaagachetwe namagena aseneirie agwo aase areenge kobaacherwa, erinde eriogi ri’enyundo, gose eri’egesire, gose eri’egekorero kende gionsi gi’ekioma tikeigugwa ase Hekalu ekero yaagachetwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egesoero kegosoera ebinyomba bia inse nigo kiareenge ensemo ya Irianyi ye Hekalu na goetera ase ebiriinero abanto nigo baarenge koriina gochia ase rirongo ria kabere, na korwa aroro bariina gochia ase rirongo ria gatato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo Sulemani akaagacha Hekalu, akayekoora. Akaroisia risang’ina ri’enyomba ne chibao chi’emecharake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboagacho bw’enyomba inse nigo bwatunyaine Hekalu, na kera rirongo nigo riareenge nobotambe gochia igoro ekerengo ki’amaboko atano. Oboagacho obwo nigo bwabwateranetigwe ne Hekalu ne chibao chi’emecharake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Sulemani, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amang’ana igoro y’enyomba eye okong’agachera bono nigo arabe iga: Korabwatie emeroberio yane echiikire na koigwera amachiiko aane onsi na koyakora, erio nainche ning’ikeranie ring’ana riane asore, riria nakwanete na Daudi iso:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche nigo ndamenye aroro ase egati y’Abaisraeli, tingotiga abanto baane Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoroisia Hekalu ime",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 3:8-14)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani akaagacha enyomba eria na akayekoora buna iga:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agatuba chinyasi chia ime y’enyomba yonsi korwa inse goika igoro ne chibao chi’emecharake, na inse y’enyomba akayetuba ne chibao chi’emetarakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaagacha akanyomba ka ime bosio kegima ase Hekalu ime, kabe Aase Aachenu Mono. Obotambe bwaye nigo bwareenge bw’ekerengo ki’amaboko emerongo ebere; akanyomba karia akagatuba ne chibao chi’emecharake, korwa inse goika igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensemo y’enyomba yareenge Hekalu enyene nigo yareenge y’ekerengo ki’amaboko emerongo ene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibao chi’emecharake chiatubete enyomba ime nigo chiareenge nemegwekano y’ebirandi, na ey’ebisicha, yabaachetwe ase chibao echio. Yonsi nigo yatubetwe nemecharake, na igena rinde tiriarorekanete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ime ye Hekalu bosio kegima nigo aroisetie akanyomba aase Esanduki y’Okobwatana y’Omonene yareenge kobekwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotambe bw’akanyomba karia ka ime nigo bwareenge obw’ekerengo ki’amaboko emerongo ebere; naboigo obogare bwaye na obotambe bwaye gochia igoro, naende nigo kaoomire netaabu echenire. Bosio bw’akanyomba karia egesasiimero gekaroisigwa, kegatubwa ne chibao chi’emecharake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani akaooma Hekalu ime netaabu engiya. Chingataare chiaoomire netaabu chikabekwa ase egesieri bosio bw’akanyomba ka ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo akaooma enyomba yonsi kegima netaabu; boigo akaooma egesasiimero gi’Aase Aachenu netaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani akaroisia emegwekano y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba babere korwa ase emete y’emezeituni, akayebeeka agwo ase akanyomba ka ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotambe bwa kera orobaaba rwa kera oyomo nigo bwareenge obw’amaboko atano; korwa ensinyo y’orobaaba oromo goika ey’oronde nigo bwareenge obotambe bw’amaboko ikomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokerubi oria onde boigo nigo areenge bw’ekerengo ekio ekio. Ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba bonsi babere nigo baarenge bareng’aine kegima ase ekerengo na bagwekaine ase ekieni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotambe bwa kera egetongwa kebwate chimbaba nigo bwareenge obw’amaboko ikomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba abwo bakabeekwa ase akanyomba karia bosio ime ye Hekalu. Chimbaaba chiabo nigo chiaramboire; orobaaba oromo rw’egetongwa kebwate chimbaba oyomo rogaika enyasi ensemo eyemo, na oromo rw’oyonde rogaika enyasi ensemo ende; gati‐gati y’enyomba orobaaba ronde rwa kera egetongwa kebwate chimbaba rogakunana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba bonsi babere bakaoomwa netaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani agachabera chinyasi chionsi chie Hekalu, na echi’akanyomba ka ime, nemegwekano y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba, na ey’emekendo, na ey’ebisicha, yabaachetwe ase chibao echio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inse ase ebinyomba ebio bibere akaooma netaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisieri bibere bikaroisigwa korwa ase chibao chi’emezeituni bikabekwa ase egesoero gi’akanyomba ka ime. Emetobwa nigo yatenenirie ensemo eyemo ya isano y’enyasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisieri ebio bionsi bibere bi’emezeituni bigachaberwa nemegwekano y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba, na ey’emekendo, na ey’ebisicha, yabaachetwe ase chibao echio. Akaooma bionsi netaabu; boigo agasiarera ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba amo ne chibao chi’emekendo netaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende emetobwa y’egesieri gie Hekalu enyene ekaroisigwa korwa ase chibao chi’emezeituni ere ne chikoona inye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ebisieri bibere bi’emetarakwa; kera egesieri nigo kiareenge ebing’ese bibere biare konyara koigorwa biaringanigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisieri ebio bigachaberwa nemegwekano y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba, na ey’emekendo na ey’ebisicha, yabaachetwe ase chibao echio, bikaoomwa buya netaabu igoro y’emegwekano eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Sulemani akaagacha chindwaki chi’eraaro ya ime. Chindwaro isato chie chindwaki echio agachiagacha namagena abaachire, na orwaro oromo akaroagacha ne chibao chi’emecharake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboroso bwe Hekalu bokabekwa ase omotienyi o Sivu, ase omwaka o kane bw’okogaamba gwa Sulemani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ase omotienyi o gatano na gatato, omotienyi o Bulu, ase omwaka o ikomi nomo, oboagacho bwe Hekalu bokaera buna yaroberetigwe. Ase igo Sulemani akaira emiaka etano na ebere ase okoagacha enyomba eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
